= The Luck Ledger

/A small sample, a strong impression./

This page records the lucky breaks and minor mishaps that made an ordinary stretch of life feel strangely symmetrical.

== Entries

=== July 6 / July 8, 2026
- *Good fortune:* Passed IELTS with exactly the score I needed.
- *Counterweight:* Periodontitis began, followed by four days of pain.

=== July 19 / July 22, 2026
- *Good fortune:* My paper was published online in /Numerical Algorithms/.
- *Counterweight:* Got my hand caught in a door.

=== July 31 / August 2, 2026
- *Good fortune:* A paper was accepted by /Applied Numerical Mathematics/.
- *Counterweight:* Bit my tongue.

=== August 22 / August 25, 2026
- *Good fortune:* A paper was accepted by /Statistics & Probability Letters/.
- *Counterweight:* Caught a cold.
